      "id": "PADEL_INVITE",
      "field": "text",
      "value": "Yo champ, anyone in the club would die for this match, but I held the slot for you\nTomorrow 7 AM vs ClosedAI CEO\n\nThat’s your dream client, man. Remember who opened this door for you 💪"
    },
